  "data": {
    "ruleType": "detachment-rule",
    "group": "Haloscreed Battle Clade",
    "summary": "In [your Command phase](vsdata:core-rule/command-phase), pick at least one **ADEPTUS MECHANICUS** unit of yours, which can include units embarked within **TRANSPORTS**. How many you can pick depends on [battle size](vsdata:core-rule/select-battle-size):\n\n- Incursion: 1\n- Strike Force: 2\n- Onslaught: 3\n\nThose units get the **HALO OVERRIDE** keyword until [your next Command phase](vsdata:core-rule/command-phase). Then pick an Override ability from the list below; your **HALO OVERRIDE** units get it until [your next Command phase](vsdata:core-rule/command-phase).\n\n- **Electromotive Energisation**: the unit's models get +2\" M.\n- **Microactuator Bracing**: the unit's models get +1 T.\n- **Predation Protocols**: the unit can declare a charge even after it [Advanced](vsdata:core-rule/advance-move) in the turn.\n- **Muted Servomotors**: the unit's models get [Stealth](vsdata:core-ability/stealth).",
